       }
      ],
      "text": "ARF:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " aspirin for everyone with arthritis and/or mild carditis (controls fever and pain). No improvement after 24–48 h of high-dose aspirin: reconsider the diagnosis."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Children/adolescents:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " most experts give 15–25 mg/kg PO 4×/day (max 4–6 g/day) for 2–4 wk, then taper over another 4 wk."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Salicylate toxicity (tinnitus, headache, hyperpnea) limits therapy and may not appear until after 1 wk; salicylate levels are measured only to manage toxicity."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Precautions:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " avoid in severe renal failure (GFR < 10 mL/min) and severe hepatic insufficiency."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
